  "description": "Editing through returned DISTINCTROW rows. Opens a dynaset on SELECT DISTINCTROW A.Label, A.Hidden FROM A INNER JOIN B, reads Updatable, sets Hidden = 'e' on the first row (Edit/Update), moves to the next row and deletes it. Also reads Updatable of the plain join and of SELECT DISTINCT. Asks each return and Errors, then all rows of A and B, which tell which physical rows were changed.",
